      en: ["Granted city status in 1971", "Famous for its red Permian sandstone buildings", "Wesselényi Beach is the largest on the north shore", "Main panoramic point: Óvári Lookout Tower", "Renowned health resort since the 19th century", "Population: approximately 9,000 residents"],
