      en: ["Seat of the Hungarian Greek Catholic Metropolia", "Historically a 'Hajdú town' with military privileges", "Greek Catholic Cathedral with unique iconostasis", "Population of roughly 8,500 residents", "Key agricultural center in Hajdú-Bihar", "Administrative center of the Archdiocese"],
