      en: ["Region: Tápió area (Pest County)", "Historical owners: Lányi and Habsburg families", "Protected area: Tápió-Hajta Landscape Protection Area", "Transport link: Budapest-Szolnok railway line", "Current population: approx. 6,200", "Primary waterway: Tápió Stream"],
